      "content": "five minutes of quiet isn't going to fix this. it's like trying to put a bandaid on a structural failure. everything i build, everything i achieve, it just builds more pressure. it's like i'm just fueling a fire that's eventually going to consume me anyway. i'm not looking for a break, i'm looking for an end to the obligation of being \"on\" all the time. it feels like the only way to actually get peace is to stop everything. permanently.",
